OL,3,GNEWSACeremonial mayor post to survive
OL,4,Acouncil abolition
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mayor and associated civic
OL,7,Ftraditions in Woking are set to remain
OL,8,Fafter the borough's council is
OL,9,Fdissolved in April.
OL,11,FWoking Borough Council said it had been
OL,12,Ftold the government would legislate to
OL,13,Fpreserve the post, currently held by
OL,14,Fcouncillor Rob Leach, which is
OL,15,Fceremonial and has no decision-making
OL,16,Fpower.
OL,18,FLocal authorities in Surrey will be
OL,19,Freorganised into two single-tier
OL,20,Fcouncils in 2027, with existing
OL,21,Fcouncils like Woking dissolved.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
