OL,3,GNEWSACeremonial mayor post to survive
OL,4,Acouncil abolition
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe proposal would create "charter
OL,7,Ftrustees" for the town, the council
OL,8,Fsaid. West Surrey Council members would
OL,9,Fbe appointed to the posts to elect the
OL,10,Fmayor and deputy mayor.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
